description: Commit message style for this repository
alwaysApply: true
---

# Commit messages

- Entire subject line in **lowercase**
- **No trailing period** (or other sentence-ending punctuation)
- Concise, imperative mood when possible (e.g. `migrate runtime to bun`)
- Prefer 1 short line; optional body only when needed for context

```text
# bad
Migrate runtime from Node/tsx to Bun.
Add OTLP gzip support.

# good
migrate runtime from node/tsx to bun
add otlp gzip support
```
